     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols\">\r\n<p>Dear Methylkit Team,</p>\r\n<p><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31,35,40)\">I apologize in advance as I am relatively new to bioinformatics.\r\n<br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31,35,40)\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31,35,40)\">I would like to use methylKit to extract the most differentially methylated genes, but I am encountering a problem with the data organization.\r\n<br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31,35,40)\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31,35,40)\">Could you please guide me on how to sort and extract these genes/islands/regions?</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31,35,40)\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31,35,40)\">Please find attachesd below the script i used to produce my results that look something like that :\r\n<br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31,35,40)\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31,35,40)\"></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"table-layout:fixed\">\r\n<colgroup width=\"129\"></colgroup><colgroup width=\"185\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"17\" align=\"left\" style=\"width:145px\">ENSEMBL</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" style=\"width:182px\">mean_meth_diff</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"17\" align=\"left\">ENSG00000065413</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">99</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"17\" align=\"left\">ENSG00000142733</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">88</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"17\" align=\"left\">ENSG00000113522</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">77</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"17\" align=\"left\" rowspan=\"1\"><br>\r\n</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\" rowspan=\"1\"><br>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"17\" align=\"left\" rowspan=\"1\">Best regards, <br>\r\n<p><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<p><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"fr\"></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman,serif\" size=\"3\" style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Alban\r\n Zimmer</span></font><font face=\"Times New Roman,serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"></span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman,serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Ingénieur\r\n apprenti</span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman,serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">PTF\r\n BioPathologie Moléculaire,</span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman,serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Bâtiment\r\n de Médecine Moléculaire</span